       <property name="html">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Arial'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;11. Método de Factorización de Cholesky&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;11.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de Cholesky es un algoritmo directo de descomposición matricial utilizado para resolver sistemas de ecuaciones lineales cuadrados (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ecuaciones con &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; incógnitas) de la forma:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(56)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Es aproximadamente el doble de rápido y requiere la mitad de memoria que los métodos generales de factorización LU (Doolittle y Crout), siendo ampliamente empleado en problemas de optimización, mínimos cuadrados y simulación numérica cuando la matriz cumple las condiciones de simetría.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;11.2. Fundamento Matemático&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El teorema de Cholesky establece que toda matriz &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ∈ ℝ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; simétrica (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) y definida positiva (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Az&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &amp;gt; 0 para todo &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ≠ 0) puede descomponerse de manera única como el producto de una matriz triangular inferior &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; (con elementos diagonales estrictamente positivos, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;l&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;ii&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &amp;gt; 0) y su transpuesta &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;LL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(57)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Al igual que en otros métodos LU, el sistema original &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;LL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; se desacopla en dos sistemas triangulares consecutivos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    y    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(58)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;11.3. Fórmulas Principales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Cálculo de los elementos de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; (Factorización):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Para cada columna &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;j&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = 1, 2, ..., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, se calcula primero el elemento de la diagonal principal y posteriormente los elementos situados por debajo de ella:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;square&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Elementos de la diagonal principal (&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;j&lt;/span&gt;):&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
